# Under Omniscience ("You may cast spells from your hand without paying their mana costs") Turn // Burn may be cast fused
# for nothing (the ruling); the row says it is fused, "Fuse: both halves - Without paying its mana cost". Turn makes Bot2's
# Ornithopter a 0/1 and Burn deals 2 damage to Bot2, with no mana spent.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Omniscience
Turn // Burn
Mox Ruby
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Omniscience)
Bot2.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Turn // Burn.Cast(Ability: Fuse: both halves - Without paying its mana cost)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = false
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
